It's a good weapon once you enchant it up, because of the double damage;
you will be paying a double penalty for an unskilled weapon, but you
will get to double your damage and strength bonuses.  (However, as an
elf, you'll never get to double the maximum strength bonus unless you
wear gauntlets of power.)

The most damaging weapon for a wizard is Frost Brand, which will be
unrestricted if you get it or another longsword as a gift.  The best
weapon is likely to be Magicbane, which you will always get as your
first gift,  

It's not even the top weapon for a Valkyrie; they can only get to basic,
while they can be expert in long sword with Frost Brand (and if lawful,
they will get Excalibur early to build up the skill).

